      en: "Registration with a valid email address and password, or via Google OAuth, is required to use Langsi. The user affirms that the information provided at registration is truthful. The user account is non-transferable. The user is obliged to keep access credentials confidential and notify the operator immediately of any suspected misuse. Users must be at least 16 years old. Minors under 16 may only use Langsi with the consent of a parent or guardian.",
